From: Gentoo PipeWire Maintainers <pipewire@gentoo.org>
Date: Sat, 2 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] spa/plugins/libcamera: Fix libcamera 0.8.0 API changes

The libcamera API changed in version 0.8.0, renaming:
- CameraLocationFront -> LocationFront
- CameraLocationBack -> LocationBack  
- CameraLocationExternal -> LocationExternal

This patch updates the pipewire source to use the new API names.

Bug: https://bugs.gentoo.org/XXXXXX
--- a/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp
+++ b/spa/plugins/libcamera/libcamera-device.cpp
@@ -69,11 +69,11 @@
 {
 	if (auto location = camera.properties().get(properties::Location)) {
 		switch (location.value()) {
-		case properties::CameraLocationFront:
+		case properties::LocationFront:
 			return "front";
-		case properties::CameraLocationBack:
+		case properties::LocationBack:
 			return "back";
-		case properties::CameraLocationExternal:
+		case properties::LocationExternal:
 			return "external";
 		}
 	}
